@startuml
[*] as InitialState
Inserted as InsertedState
PIN_Entered as PIN_EnteredState
PIN_Validated as PIN_ValidatedState
Options_Provided as Options_ProvidedState
Withdrawal_Processing as Withdrawal_ProcessingState
Cash_Dispensed as Cash_DispensedState
Receipt_Printed as Receipt_PrintedState
Card_Returned as Card_ReturnedState

InitialState ->> InsertedState : Card inserted
InsertedState ->> PIN_EnteredState : Prompt user to enter PIN
PIN_EnteredState ->> PIN_ValidatedState : Successful PIN verification
PIN_ValidatedState ->> Options_ProvidedState : System provides options to user
Options_ProvidedState ->> Withdrawal_ProcessingState : User approves withdrawal request
Withdrawal_ProcessingState ->> Cash_DispensedState : Cash dispensed to user
Cash_DispensedState ->> Receipt_PrintedState : Receipt printed for transaction
Receipt_PrintedState ->> Card_ReturnedState : User's card returned
Card_ReturnedState ->> InitialState : System resets itself and becomes ready for next user

@enduml
